commit 6dc27f0f2185ea864873d92c3dcd3236c168543e
Author: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 7 19:25:17 2026 +0000

    Caption the component-body departures under the user's rulings R4, R5, and R6 (unit AS4)
    
    Each specimen that keeps a bare paragraph, divider, nested list, legend,
    option, table caption, or heading inside Bootstrap's own markup states
    what preflight changes under the layer, pinned by a readings row; the
    Tailwind section's introduction states the important-helper rule and the
    two exceptions (the bare a element, the 16 percentage names); the
    Borders section states the two subtle-border collisions; the Fixed text
    colors figure carries a note through the new Owner.note field that
    createFigure renders; a "Carousel caption in Bootstrap's markup"
    specimen reads the bare h5 and p under the three faces; the guide gains
    the Section.caption and Owner.note paragraph, the Scrollspy face-switch
    lifecycle, and the rows; the caption-readings budget moves to 30,000 ms
    on a 20,836 ms measurement with 112 rows.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017fwYCgxCd9JhL43kVBLBJV

